# Planted bugs for the cluster-majority design. Each one must make its
# property fail.
run fv-tlc LeaderElection.tla ClusterMajority.cfg WitnessLeader.cfg
properties AtMostOneLeaderPerTerm
file LeaderElection.tla

mutation a candidate counts only the votes it can see, not the whole cluster
detects AtMostOneLeaderPerTerm
-     /\ 2 * Cardinality(VotesFor(candidate)) > Cardinality(Node)
+     /\ 2 * Cardinality(VotesFor(candidate) \cap Reachable(candidate)) > Cardinality(Reachable(candidate))

harmless a comment on the cluster-majority rule
- \* Source: node.become_leader(), counting votes against the whole cluster.
+ \* Source: node.become_leader(). It counts votes against the whole cluster.
